    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "3d88cbb84f3ee44b9474": "Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage.",
        "7e18fe0a4517a99cd726": "$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself.",
        "84e9f3287f4eece7dd5a": "Welcome back to the Great Forge, $n. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?",
        "9cd5dc9051535b78ab60": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Grumnus Steelshaper",
      "subName": "Armor Crafter",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
